				{ type = "quest", id = 20 },
				{ type = "quest", id = 19 },
			},
			text = [=[The orcs came from the {link:burning-steppes}Burning Steppes{/link}, took the keep and penned the people of {link:lakeshire}Lakeshire{/link} in their own town. Marris asked for their axes as proof, and then for the head of {link:tharil-zun}Tharil'zun{/link}, the crafty {link:orcs}orc{/link} who led the ambushes on the {link:stonewatch-keep}Stonewatch{/link} road.]=],
