		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Bellygrub is a great boar who forages in the fields south-west of {link:lakeshire}Lakeshire{/link}. Now and then he wanders into {link:martie-jainrose}Martie Jainrose{/link}'s garden and eats or tramples everything in it. {link:marshal-marris}Marshal Marris{/link} gave him his name, and it has stuck. The fields where he forages lie close to the town, and his tusk is worth a reward from the herbalist.]=],
