			title = "Their Ways",
			text = [=[The Redridge gnolls take what the war leaves unguarded. They seized the caravan that carried iron for the {link:lake-everstill}Everstill{/link} Bridge. They steal horses from the stable of {link:lakeshire}Lakeshire{/link}. They have moved into the {link:rethban-caverns}Rethban Caverns{/link}, where their drudgers dig the ore that the town once mined. They are loosely organized, but they respect strength above all else. {link:deputy-feldon}Deputy Feldon{/link} hopes that the death of their fiercest thrashers will teach the rest to stay in the hills. In Rethban, a {link:gnolls}gnoll{/link} named Ardo Dirtpaw leads the pack that holds the caverns.]=],
